      "verified_body_exactly_equals_approved_draft_body": true,
      "body": "Hello maintainers,\n\nWe are reviewing the unmodified eastasianwidth 0.2.0 npm package, gitHead b89f04d44dc786885615e94cd6e2ba1ef7866fa4, for development within a single organization. We are following this existing issue rather than opening a duplicate.\n\nWe found the authentic MIT-LICENSE.txt added by commit 1d41951a59d63fb2d77cda021050fc070cae424a on 2024-06-05, beginning \"Copyright komagata\". At that commit package.json is version 0.3.0, and eastasianwidth.js differs from the 0.2.0 source. We therefore have not assumed that this later notice settles the older version's exact notice obligations.\n\nCould a maintainer confirm whether that complete notice also applies to the unmodified 0.2.0 release? If a different notice is required, please provide the original wording or an authoritative fixed reference. The 0.2.0 README credits takenspc's East Asian Width article; please also clarify whether incorporated code/data is covered by the stated MIT grant or needs additional attribution or terms.\n\nThis is an information request only. It does not request paid work, a purchase, relicensing, or a new contract. No project files or internal deployment information are attached. Thank you.\n",
      "screenshot_ref": "docs/00-project/validation/native-n01-admission-decisions/upstream-eastasianwidth-comment.png",
      "screenshot_sha256": "c670199e6af04c361df3843221cef8b2b49afd983b15b11142fa931eab5a11cc"
    },
