      "verified_body_exactly_equals_approved_draft_body": true,
      "body": "Hello maintainers,\n\nWe are reviewing @npmcli/agent 3.0.0, gitHead 94f346d882458ac9481d015c55057d15f5899bf1, as an unchanged dependency of an internally used development toolchain within a single organization.\n\nThe exact published archive and source revision declare ISC but we did not find the complete copyright and permission notice. This issue's subject is version 4.0.0; an existing participant also asks about 3.0.0. We are following that request and have not treated another participant's question or package author metadata as a publisher grant.\n\nCould an authorized maintainer identify the complete original notice applicable to 3.0.0, including the precise holder/year wording if any? If an organization-wide, npm aggregate or other notice applies, please identify its authoritative location and explicitly confirm its package/version scope. We will preserve that wording rather than infer it from another release or an ISC template.\n\nThis is an information request only, not paid work, relicensing, a purchase or a new contract. No project files or internal deployment information are attached. Thank you.\n",
      "screenshot_ref": "docs/00-project/validation/native-n01-admission-decisions/upstream-agent-comment.png",
